WEBVTT

00:00.920 --> 00:07.592
As I stand in the wind on a hill by a port town,

00:00.920 --> 00:07.592
minatomachi oka no ue kaze wo uke

00:07.656 --> 00:14.683
mezurashii kurai atama wa karappo

00:07.656 --> 00:14.683
my head feels unusually empty.

00:15.268 --> 00:21.940
I was watching the town from the south side of the shore.

00:15.268 --> 00:21.940
haruka minami mukougishi de kono machi wo miteita

00:21.965 --> 00:28.179
And so I sunk my unsteady passion into the depths of the sea.

00:21.965 --> 00:28.179
guratsuita jounetsu wo umi ni shizumeta

00:29.073 --> 00:34.745
This surging power...

00:29.073 --> 00:34.745
tome donaku afureru chikara

00:29.073 --> 00:31.160
Black Jack

00:36.247 --> 00:42.502
It's something hidden in everyone, everywhere.

00:36.247 --> 00:42.502
sonnamono wa darenimo dokonimo hisonde iru mono

00:43.296 --> 00:48.258
Day after day, everyone tries their best.

00:43.296 --> 00:48.258
mainichi mainichi minna ganbaru

00:49.829 --> 00:57.184
But people get annoyed when I mention it.

00:49.829 --> 00:57.184
sore wo ieba hito wa mina kemutagaru

00:57.685 --> 00:59.376
Oh FREEDOM

00:59.376 --> 01:01.369
will be there

01:01.389 --> 01:04.349
It makes me glad...

01:01.389 --> 01:04.349
yokatta

01:04.594 --> 01:12.074
That I found my place here.

01:04.594 --> 01:12.074
ibasho ga koko ni attakara

01:12.127 --> 01:13.645
Oh WISDOM

01:13.645 --> 01:15.494
will be there

01:15.522 --> 01:18.163
I searched for the reason

01:15.522 --> 01:18.163
sagashita

01:18.164 --> 01:25.212
why we can believe in the same air

01:18.164 --> 01:25.212
onaji kuuki shinjirarerukoto

01:25.797 --> 01:32.677
as long as we're alive.

01:25.797 --> 01:32.677
ínochi aru kagiri

01:32.678 --> 01:34.763
He weaves the thread of life with his miraculous control of a scalpel.

01:34.847 --> 01:37.031
The genius surgeon who lives on a cape.

01:37.183 --> 01:39.794
His name is Black Jack.

01:51.920 --> 01:55.020
Originally "The Invader" by Tezuka Osamu.

01:51.920 --> 01:55.020
An Invader from the Sky

02:00.012 --> 02:01.130
Alien invaders.

02:03.056 --> 02:05.641
They strike terror from outer space.

02:07.232 --> 02:11.480
They inject different kinds of viruses in humans...

02:11.481 --> 02:13.442
and do other experiments on them.

02:22.310 --> 02:25.160
Sheesh. You're watching TV with the lights off again.

02:25.161 --> 02:26.411
Oh, Mom.

02:26.412 --> 02:28.163
Hello.

02:28.164 --> 02:30.314
You were watching that weird DVD again?

02:30.667 --> 02:32.334
Time for a snack.

02:34.754 --> 02:37.172
Satoru! That's bad manners!

02:37.173 --> 02:38.423
What's wrong with it?

02:39.550 --> 02:40.884
You got something on your nose.

02:41.185 --> 02:42.485
Stop it.

02:42.805 --> 02:43.805
OK. OK.

02:44.222 --> 02:48.809
Sharaku-kun, I have a piece for your sister
too, so give it to her when you go home.

02:48.810 --> 02:50.477
Thank you.

02:53.189 --> 02:56.233
I really envy you for having such a kind mom.

02:56.234 --> 02:57.067
You really think so?

02:57.068 --> 02:58.277
Yes, I do!

02:58.278 --> 02:59.695
My sister is...

02:59.696 --> 03:01.613
Sharaku!

03:02.115 --> 03:03.063
What's the matter?

03:03.283 --> 03:05.656
It's nothing.

03:08.288 --> 03:11.623
Hey, do you think alien invaders really exist?

03:12.000 --> 03:13.674
Space is so big.

03:13.876 --> 03:15.893
I wouldn't be surprised if they did.

03:16.963 --> 03:17.874
What's wrong?

03:26.416 --> 03:27.347
Sharaku!

03:27.638 --> 03:29.850
P-Pinoco-chan, what were you doing?

03:29.851 --> 03:30.642
Shopping.

03:30.643 --> 03:31.653
Carry this.

03:33.438 --> 03:34.736
What's that?

03:34.965 --> 03:35.916
Oh, this?

03:35.940 --> 03:37.274
It's a cake.

03:37.363 --> 03:39.360
Let me see!

03:38.151 --> 03:40.068
No! Don't!

03:40.069 --> 03:43.072
It's for my sister!

03:41.863 --> 03:43.636
I just want to see it.

03:43.072 --> 03:43.614
No!

03:45.491 --> 03:47.326
It looks yummy!

03:47.480 --> 03:49.411
I'm digging in!

03:49.954 --> 03:51.552
Hey, Sharaku!

04:04.160 --> 04:05.422
<i>That light...</i>

04:06.554 --> 04:08.134
<i>What was it?</i>

04:09.717 --> 04:11.355
<i>Could it be a UFO?</i>

04:12.435 --> 04:13.672
No way...

04:13.937 --> 04:14.811
Ouch!

04:14.969 --> 04:16.438
What is that?

04:20.276 --> 04:24.311
So this would be x = 6-2x...

04:23.321 --> 04:25.989
Sharaku!

04:24.621 --> 04:25.861
Hey, Sharaku!

04:26.435 --> 04:27.435
Hey, Sharaku!

04:28.408 --> 04:29.136
What?

04:29.160 --> 04:30.410
Well...

04:31.204 --> 04:34.658
Has anything weird happened
to your body since yestenday?

04:35.959 --> 04:38.335
Oh, my stomach hurts a little.

04:39.170 --> 04:41.129
I ate too much breakfast.

04:41.673 --> 04:43.180
Not that!

04:43.383 --> 04:47.160
Anyway, that light yesterday was cool, wasn't it?

04:47.553 --> 04:49.471
- Do you really think it was a UFO?

04:49.599 --> 04:51.098
Sharaku! Turn around!

04:51.654 --> 04:52.641
Turn around?

04:53.476 --> 04:56.298
And what were you saying about UFOs?
You're in math class right now.

04:56.562 --> 04:58.400
Go to the board and solve the problem!

05:01.552 --> 05:03.552
Odazaki General Hospital

05:13.562 --> 05:15.622
Your pee was red?

05:15.623 --> 05:16.256
Yes.

05:16.499 --> 05:18.375
How is he, doctor?

05:18.835 --> 05:20.689
I can't tell yet.

05:21.087 --> 05:23.839
I'd like to keep him here for a while for another check-up.

05:24.676 --> 05:25.882
For a while?

05:25.883 --> 05:27.751
Just until it's over.

05:40.607 --> 05:42.733
Don't worry. It'll be over quickly.

05:42.734 --> 05:44.276
It is just a check-up.

05:44.375 --> 05:45.974
This is a rare case.

05:46.237 --> 05:47.321
Have you done a blood test?

05:54.704 --> 05:56.079
What was that?

06:00.001 --> 06:00.886
Open up!

06:01.127 --> 06:02.294
Open the door! Somebody!

06:02.295 --> 06:03.211
Dang...

06:03.212 --> 06:04.133
Open up!

06:05.882 --> 06:07.852
What's the matter, Satoru-kun?

06:08.134 --> 06:09.134
I...

06:09.654 --> 06:10.940
I want to go out.

06:11.181 --> 06:11.780
No.

06:11.804 --> 06:13.013
You have to stay here.

06:13.242 --> 06:15.307
Let's go back to bed, shall we?

06:15.683 --> 06:18.101
Show me your arm, Satoru-kun.

06:18.367 --> 06:19.906
I'll give you a sedative.

06:25.276 --> 06:28.946
As you can see, he hasn't touched his breakfast.

06:28.947 --> 06:30.572
You should eat, Satoru-kun.

06:32.408 --> 06:33.399
Doctor.

06:33.576 --> 06:34.326
What is it?

06:35.036 --> 06:37.109
Am I really here just for a check-up?

06:38.498 --> 06:40.165
Why's that?

06:40.431 --> 06:42.327
Of course you are.

06:45.004 --> 06:46.546
Satoru!

06:47.173 --> 06:48.048
Mom.

06:48.049 --> 06:53.845
What's this I hear about you causing trouble
and also not eating anything?

06:53.846 --> 06:55.847
I don't want to eat the food here.

06:56.126 --> 06:57.975
Don't be so selfish.

06:57.976 --> 06:59.559
That's not it.

07:00.519 --> 07:03.897
That doctor's not acting normal.

07:04.482 --> 07:05.941
Dr. Taguchi?

07:05.942 --> 07:06.817
Yeah.

07:06.818 --> 07:09.837
And the other doctors and nurses too.

07:12.122 --> 07:14.491
Ma'am, may I have a minute?

07:14.722 --> 07:15.752
OK.

07:16.119 --> 07:17.661
Give me a minute with him.

07:17.743 --> 07:18.430
Mom!

07:18.454 --> 07:20.163
I'll be right back.

07:22.458 --> 07:24.376
<i>What are they going to discuss?</i>

07:25.556 --> 07:26.795
Satoru-kun!

07:27.338 --> 07:28.714
Sharaku.

07:28.715 --> 07:31.883
Hmm. This is a pretty clean room.

07:31.884 --> 07:33.385
Here. These are for you.

07:33.832 --> 07:35.595
Your favorite action figure and book.

07:37.899 --> 07:40.183
Uh, Satoru-kun?

07:40.184 --> 07:41.854
What's the matter? Did something happen?

07:43.313 --> 07:45.897
The doctors here are acting strange.

07:47.012 --> 07:51.498
They look at me with cold, emotionless eyes.

07:51.997 --> 07:54.781
Almost as if they're possessed by alien invaders.

07:55.825 --> 07:59.453
Maybe they're going to use me as
a lab rat and run tests on me.

08:02.624 --> 08:09.034
This book says that their first step is
to always take over human bodies.

08:09.130 --> 08:13.265
They then pretend to be earthlings and
run various experiments on real ones.

08:13.676 --> 08:17.503
Nobody asks questions when hospital
workers run tests, you know.

08:18.348 --> 08:19.588
Could they be...

08:20.725 --> 08:23.936
Oh, Sharaku-kun, you came to visit him?

08:24.938 --> 08:26.124
Thank you.

08:26.481 --> 08:27.790
S-Sure.

08:28.566 --> 08:31.114
Satoru, l'm going home for today.

08:31.634 --> 08:32.387
Mom?

08:33.446 --> 08:36.799
I'll bring you your favorite food tomorrow.

08:37.825 --> 08:39.279
Wait!

08:40.036 --> 08:42.287
She looked different than usual.

08:43.039 --> 08:44.145
Those eyes...

08:44.499 --> 08:47.084
They were the same cold eyes those doctors had.

08:48.724 --> 08:49.620
Dang!

08:50.213 --> 08:51.296
Satoru-kun!

08:51.965 --> 08:54.673
A space invader must have taken over Mom.

08:55.134 --> 08:56.914
Mom is now a space invader...

08:57.136 --> 08:58.220
No way!

08:58.406 --> 09:01.556
Please, Sharaku, go check outside.

09:02.475 --> 09:04.819
They won't let me out of this room.

09:05.103 --> 09:06.603
At this rate, Mom will...

09:06.604 --> 09:07.754
I'll right.

09:08.523 --> 09:11.525
Satoru-kun, you shouldn't be out of bed.

09:11.675 --> 09:12.985
I'm counting on you, Sharaku.

09:13.048 --> 09:14.528
Yeah. Wait here.

09:15.238 --> 09:18.073
Let's go back to bed.

09:18.700 --> 09:19.950
S-Satoru-kun?!

09:34.173 --> 09:35.257
Satoru!

09:35.800 --> 09:37.217
Satoru! This way!

09:38.553 --> 09:40.262
This way, Satoru!

09:41.848 --> 09:43.611
Let's go!

09:44.559 --> 09:45.517
Wait!

09:46.019 --> 09:47.728
Wait!

09:50.607 --> 09:51.898
<i>It was just a dream.</i>

10:11.207 --> 10:12.070
Satoru.

10:13.546 --> 10:14.609
Mom.

10:14.839 --> 10:16.590
I brought you some food.

10:17.643 --> 10:20.218
I made all your favorites.

10:20.629 --> 10:21.928
I brought some cake too.

10:22.889 --> 10:24.991
You should eat something.

10:28.102 --> 10:29.159
What's the matter?

10:29.479 --> 10:32.105
Did you run into Sharaku, Mom?

10:33.149 --> 10:36.485
I asked him not to come.

10:37.153 --> 10:38.192
You asked him not to come?

10:40.365 --> 10:42.282
Not just Sharaku-kun.

10:42.778 --> 10:47.120
Seeing visitors right now will just tax your health,
so I asked everyone to stay away for a while.

10:47.900 --> 10:49.831
Wait, Mom!

10:49.832 --> 10:51.124
Get Sharaku here!

10:51.930 --> 10:52.623
No!

10:53.003 --> 10:55.733
I want to get out of this room, Mom!

10:56.965 --> 11:00.509
Satoru, listen to what the doctor says.

11:06.933 --> 11:08.414
So Mom is...

11:09.852 --> 11:10.971
Mom is...

11:17.193 --> 11:19.736
Mom is a space invader...

11:27.453 --> 11:28.704
Satoru-kun.

11:29.580 --> 11:32.833
You're not going to get better if you
don't eat or take your medicine.

11:33.960 --> 11:34.925
Satoru-kun...

11:36.170 --> 11:38.118
Doctor, I...

11:38.673 --> 11:41.091
I want to go into the hallway.

11:41.341 --> 11:42.168
The hallway?

11:42.347 --> 11:43.867
I can't allow that.

11:44.387 --> 11:45.415
Why?!

11:45.638 --> 11:47.764
You just can't step out of this room.

11:48.058 --> 11:49.391
I know why!

11:49.392 --> 11:52.394
It's because I'll find out the truth if I do!

11:52.627 --> 11:53.790
The truth?

11:55.481 --> 11:57.816
You're misunderstanding something.

11:57.817 --> 11:59.355
There's no use hiding it from me!

11:59.611 --> 12:03.945
Outside of that door, you guys are walking
around in your true forms!

12:06.117 --> 12:07.659
You're alien invaders!

12:07.702 --> 12:08.493
Dang!

12:08.494 --> 12:09.578
No, Satoru-kun!

12:09.579 --> 12:10.579
Shut up! Let me go!

12:16.294 --> 12:17.391
Satoru-kun!

12:28.890 --> 12:30.057
It hurts...

12:31.184 --> 12:33.185
Somebody help...

12:38.316 --> 12:39.441
Please...

12:39.442 --> 12:40.692
Help me!

12:43.780 --> 12:45.280
Help...

13:03.466 --> 13:04.426
Satoru.

13:05.760 --> 13:06.576
Satoru!

13:10.472 --> 13:11.807
Y-You're...

13:12.850 --> 13:14.309
I'm here for you.

13:15.019 --> 13:16.645
This place is full of alien invaders.

13:16.646 --> 13:18.272
Let's escape!

13:20.900 --> 13:22.439
Come with me.

13:22.819 --> 13:24.035
Wait up!

13:31.995 --> 13:33.036
You saved me.

13:33.037 --> 13:34.913
I was really in trouble, surrounded
by hostile creatures like that.

13:34.914 --> 13:35.697
Here!

13:39.877 --> 13:41.120
What are you doing?!

13:41.579 --> 13:42.940
Hurry up and jump!

13:43.131 --> 13:44.144
But...

13:44.424 --> 13:45.632
Jump over it!

13:45.633 --> 13:47.301
Or else you won't be safe!

13:47.665 --> 13:49.261
Gather your courage and jump!

13:49.262 --> 13:49.970
Hurry!

13:49.971 --> 13:51.054
They're right behind you!

13:53.016 --> 13:54.558
Satoru-kun!

13:54.559 --> 13:55.767
Satoru!

13:56.394 --> 13:59.104
Satoru-kun!

14:03.276 --> 14:04.443
It was just a dream.

14:05.303 --> 14:06.464
Results from ultrasound?

14:06.654 --> 14:07.937
His vitals are stable.

14:08.114 --> 14:09.535
Prepare for an emergency operation.

14:12.241 --> 14:14.202
Looks like he's conscious again.

14:14.203 --> 14:15.621
Thank goodness.

14:16.005 --> 14:18.281
Why did you run outside?

14:18.541 --> 14:20.584
You know why and you're just playing dumb!

14:21.878 --> 14:25.547
It seems he's misunderstood something.

14:25.886 --> 14:26.976
He misunderstood something?

14:27.842 --> 14:29.384
About what?

14:29.874 --> 14:32.729
My mom doesn't talk like that!

14:33.056 --> 14:34.556
You mustn't move!

14:36.101 --> 14:37.100
Satoru!

14:37.143 --> 14:38.435
Get back in bed!

14:38.937 --> 14:43.357
You're going to take me away and use me for experiments!

14:46.912 --> 14:48.658
Stop it, Satoru-kun!

14:48.870 --> 14:49.511
What's the matter?!

14:49.550 --> 14:50.379
Calm down!

14:50.424 --> 14:51.156
Shut up!.

14:53.052 --> 14:53.677
Satoru!

14:53.677 --> 14:54.345
Let go!

14:54.369 --> 14:55.410
Let go of me!

14:58.623 --> 15:00.999
You evil alien invaders, don't touch me!

15:01.000 --> 15:01.833
Hey!

15:05.171 --> 15:06.463
Who are you?!

15:06.707 --> 15:08.084
What was that for?!

15:08.431 --> 15:09.904
He's a patient!

15:10.613 --> 15:12.483
He won't settle down otherwise.

15:12.929 --> 15:14.096
I know.

15:14.555 --> 15:16.598
You must be their boss.

15:16.950 --> 15:18.401
I'm actually a doctor.

15:18.977 --> 15:21.770
Quit lying, invader!

15:22.230 --> 15:25.370
Look, I've been called here to operate on you.

15:25.650 --> 15:28.174
They can't help you anymore.

15:28.653 --> 15:30.529
Your case is that bad.

15:32.365 --> 15:35.367
You have a tumor on your kidney.

15:35.368 --> 15:37.136
You'll lose weight and eventually die.

15:37.630 --> 15:39.705
N-No way...

15:39.905 --> 15:40.789
Doctor!

15:40.790 --> 15:42.867
You shouldn't be telling him that!

15:43.418 --> 15:44.710
And why not?

15:45.064 --> 15:48.422
If it's hopeless, it's best to just tell him that!

15:48.658 --> 15:50.191
That's a lie...

15:50.508 --> 15:51.969
I'll tell you more then.

15:52.449 --> 15:55.387
If we just leave it alone, you will live
for another week at the most.

15:56.764 --> 15:58.202
Please stop!

15:58.322 --> 15:59.163
That's a lie!

15:59.725 --> 16:01.643
It's all a lie.

16:01.644 --> 16:02.376
No.

16:03.646 --> 16:05.105
He's telling the truth.

16:05.732 --> 16:08.472
I knew it yesterday morning.

16:08.776 --> 16:12.781
We've done everything we could so you wouldn't find out.

16:13.239 --> 16:16.116
Your mother has especially tried...

16:17.076 --> 16:18.285
Mom...

16:20.406 --> 16:22.497
I'm sorry, Satoru.

16:22.767 --> 16:25.168
I see... That's why...

16:25.668 --> 16:28.453
That's why everyone started acting
so strange all of a sudden.

16:29.378 --> 16:31.458
You weren't alien invaders.

16:35.228 --> 16:36.441
Ouch...

16:36.810 --> 16:37.615
Satoru!

16:37.639 --> 16:38.472
Satoru-kun!

16:40.266 --> 16:41.655
I don't want to die.

16:41.748 --> 16:42.453
This isn't good.

16:42.477 --> 16:43.644
His condition is worsening fast!

16:43.645 --> 16:45.197
Don't die, Satoru!

16:45.237 --> 16:46.237
¥30,000,000.

16:47.231 --> 16:48.916
The operation will cost ¥30,000,000.

16:49.400 --> 16:50.459
Can you pay?

16:51.508 --> 16:52.611
I'll pay.

16:52.612 --> 16:54.683
No matter how much it costs!

16:54.948 --> 16:57.115
So please save him!

17:04.874 --> 17:06.583
Prepare for an emergency operation!

17:09.504 --> 17:10.712
Doctor.

17:12.340 --> 17:16.176
Doctor, please let me stay by Satoru's
side during the operation.

17:16.594 --> 17:18.178
Please!

17:20.765 --> 17:21.640
Feel free to.

17:24.936 --> 17:26.645
There are two metastatic tumors on the lung.

17:26.646 --> 17:29.648
We will extirpate the tumor on the right kidney
and metastatic ones on the right lung.

17:30.441 --> 17:31.375
Scalpel.

17:32.235 --> 17:33.318
Check his vitals.

17:33.319 --> 17:34.486
Keep,your eyes on them.

17:34.487 --> 17:35.112
Yes.

17:35.905 --> 17:37.155
<i>Satoru.</i>

17:42.161 --> 17:43.212
Satoru!

17:43.538 --> 17:44.746
What are you doing?

17:45.415 --> 17:46.748
What are you doing, Satoru?

17:46.749 --> 17:48.431
You're...

17:52.755 --> 17:55.048
They'll catch up to you!

17:55.049 --> 17:55.642
Come on!

17:55.925 --> 17:57.009
B-But...

17:57.635 --> 17:59.419
They're all lying.

17:59.762 --> 18:02.222
That man in black is an invader!

18:02.514 --> 18:03.932
Here they come!

18:15.598 --> 18:16.191
Kocher forceps.

18:16.238 --> 18:16.903
Yes.

18:17.322 --> 18:18.905
Blood pressure and heart rate are dropping.

18:19.574 --> 18:21.247
Administer a vasopressor.

18:22.076 --> 18:23.118
Prepare for a blood transfusion.

18:23.119 --> 18:23.637
Hurry!

18:24.954 --> 18:26.538
Hurry and jump!

18:26.539 --> 18:28.081
Come to this side of the world!

18:29.083 --> 18:30.500
B-But...

18:33.921 --> 18:35.881
What is that side of the world like?

18:36.377 --> 18:39.725
It's a world where there's no longer pain or suffering.

18:40.261 --> 18:41.887
No suffering...

18:42.699 --> 18:43.965
Come on!

18:50.855 --> 18:52.439
Come on!

18:52.592 --> 18:53.974
Wait!

18:54.192 --> 18:55.901
Don't pull so hard!

18:56.341 --> 18:58.547
It'll feel better once you come to this side.

18:59.030 --> 19:00.906
Come!

19:02.408 --> 19:04.079
Help!

19:05.662 --> 19:07.829
Nobody will be coming to help you!

19:07.830 --> 19:10.149
Help!

19:10.875 --> 19:12.542
Oxygen saturation is still going down.

19:12.543 --> 19:14.127
Doctor, at this rate...

19:14.128 --> 19:14.996
I know!

19:15.338 --> 19:16.338
Raise O2 to the max.

19:16.923 --> 19:18.256
Increase blood flow to max too!

19:38.653 --> 19:39.611
Ma'am,

19:40.738 --> 19:43.264
would you hold Satoru-kun's hand?

19:44.367 --> 19:45.233
OK.

19:46.828 --> 19:49.334
Come with me!

19:56.254 --> 19:57.394
That's...

19:58.298 --> 19:59.818
Mom's hand!

20:01.474 --> 20:02.860
Please, Satoru.

20:03.492 --> 20:06.388
Don't leave me behind, Satoru.

20:08.808 --> 20:10.100
Mom!

20:10.317 --> 20:11.351
It's useless!

20:11.352 --> 20:12.811
Now, come over here!

20:14.823 --> 20:16.523
Come!

20:22.071 --> 20:23.113
Mom!

20:24.407 --> 20:25.616
Mom!

20:26.492 --> 20:27.784
It's so warm.

20:47.600 --> 20:48.764
Satoru...

20:48.765 --> 20:49.872
Blood pressure's rising again!

20:51.065 --> 20:52.796
His condition's stabilizing.

20:53.221 --> 20:53.850
Good.

20:54.101 --> 20:54.694
Now for the excision.

20:55.068 --> 20:55.595
Yes.

21:03.905 --> 21:06.156
I'm glad you're getting better.

21:06.157 --> 21:07.824
Of course!

21:07.825 --> 21:09.451
Doc worked on you, after all.

21:09.732 --> 21:12.287
Sorry for making you worry so much

21:12.434 --> 21:13.747
Oh yeah!

21:13.748 --> 21:17.376
I checked out that mysterious light from the other day.

21:18.252 --> 21:19.836
Look at this.

21:20.797 --> 21:22.923
It was a large fireball.

21:23.137 --> 21:24.257
A fireball?

21:24.422 --> 21:27.094
It was a shooting star?

21:28.221 --> 21:30.049
So it wasn't a UFO.

21:30.390 --> 21:31.292
I see...

21:31.683 --> 21:33.183
Of course it wasn't.

21:35.353 --> 21:36.728
Oh, welcome.

21:36.940 --> 21:38.277
Hello.

21:38.898 --> 21:41.566
Someone gave us a cake.

21:41.567 --> 21:43.151
How about we split it?

21:43.869 --> 21:45.320
Yay!

21:50.576 --> 21:54.329
Does your mom still look like an alien invader?

21:54.831 --> 21:56.081
Fine then.

21:57.250 --> 21:59.793
We'll split the cake between the two of us.

21:59.794 --> 22:00.460
Yay!

22:00.461 --> 22:02.087
Aye-aye!

22:02.088 --> 22:04.756
Mom! I didn't say that!

22:10.548 --> 22:17.554
I want to capture your heart with my silly smile.

22:10.548 --> 22:17.554
itazura no hohemi de muchuu ni sasetaino

22:17.555 --> 22:24.727
Only look straight at me.

22:17.555 --> 22:24.727
massugu na kimi no me ni watashi wo utsushitene

22:24.772 --> 22:32.029
Being kind isn't good enough.

22:24.772 --> 22:32.029
yasashii dake dewa nanika tarinaino

22:32.030 --> 22:42.539
I want to get in touch with your true heart, deep
within the you that nobody else sees.

22:32.030 --> 22:42.539
dare nimo misenai kokoro no oku no sotto furetai

22:42.540 --> 22:47.920
Being in the gentle sunlight,

22:42.540 --> 22:47.920
yawaraka na hizashi abite

22:47.921 --> 22:57.304
I wish on the clover that plays the melody of dreams,

22:47.921 --> 22:53.126
yume wo kanaderu clover

22:53.581 --> 22:57.305
kaze ni negai wo nosete

22:57.305 --> 23:08.065
and I search for a ray of hope beyond the blue skies,

22:57.305 --> 23:08.065
aoi sora no mukou e kibou no hikari sagasuno

23:08.066 --> 23:13.153
because I want to stay by your side forever.

23:08.066 --> 23:13.153
zutto soba ni itakara

23:13.154 --> 23:26.124
The promise we made long ago in a far away place...

23:13.154 --> 23:26.124
haruka kanata de zutto mae kara

23:26.125 --> 23:33.048
is finally coming to a realization, overcoming the incredible distance,

23:26.125 --> 23:33.048
hikari ni terasare michibikareru youni

23:33.049 --> 23:43.934
just as it was lead by the light.

23:33.049 --> 23:36.982
sora no hate tooku

23:37.075 --> 23:43.875
toki wo koete ima tadori tsuku

23:45.174 --> 24:15.130
The Shaky Operating Room

23:46.214 --> 23:47.394
Hang in there, dear!

23:47.481 --> 23:48.181
Stop it!

23:48.314 --> 23:49.001
Don't touch her!

23:49.094 --> 23:50.094
Wait!

23:50.154 --> 23:51.601
I want no operations.

23:51.994 --> 23:54.728
If we don't treat her now, she'll die for sure.

23:55.134 --> 23:56.514
If I mess up even one stitch,

23:56.581 --> 23:58.622
the wound will open up and we'll
be right back where we started.

23:58.756 --> 24:01.803
I can't do anything if it keeps
shaking so hard!

24:02.042 --> 24:03.843
Please save her!

24:04.164 --> 24:05.204
Please leave.

24:05.537 --> 24:07.112
Before the next train comes...

24:08.025 --> 24:09.686
Doctor, it's coming!

24:09.946 --> 24:11.626
Please! Don't come yet!

24:12.112 --> 24:14.725
Next Karte - The Shaky Operating Room.

24:16.257 --> 24:17.919
Karte NG...

24:18.442 --> 24:19.344
Sharaku! Turn around!

24:19.573 --> 24:20.198
Turn around?

24:21.821 --> 24:23.787
Ouch!
